                    "content": "```java\nimport java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int HPY = scanner.nextInt();\n        int ATKY = scanner.nextInt();\n        int DEFY = scanner.nextInt();\n        int HPM = scanner.nextInt();\n        int ATKM = scanner.nextInt();\n        int DEFM = scanner.nextInt();\n        int h = scanner.nextInt();\n        int a = scanner.nextInt();\n        int d = scanner.nextInt();\n\n        long minCost = Long.MAX_VALUE;\n\n        for (int da = 0; da <= 200; da++) {\n            int atkNew = ATKY + da;\n            int monsterDmg = atkNew - DEFM;\n            if (monsterDmg <= 0) continue;\n\n            int turns = (HPM + monsterDmg - 1) / monsterDmg;\n\n            for (int dd = 0; dd <= 200; dd++) {\n                int defNew = DEFY + dd;\n                int yangDmgPerTurn = ATKM - defNew;\n                if (yangDmgPerTurn < 0) yangDmgPerTurn = 0;\n\n                long neededHP = (long) yangDmgPerTurn * (turns - 1) + 1;\n                long hpAdd = neededHP - HPY;\n                if (hpAdd < 0) hpAdd = 0;\n\n                long cost = (long) a * da + (long) d * dd + (long) h * hpAdd;\n                if (cost < minCost) {\n                    minCost = cost;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        System.out.println(minCost);\n    }\n}\n```",
